# 名称: Custom_Direct
# 添加应路由到 DIRECT 的规则。
#
# 示例:
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,example.cn
# DOMAIN,exact.example.cn
# IP-CIDR,192.0.2.0/24,no-resolve
# DST-PORT,8443

AND,((SRC-IP-CIDR,10.0.0.3/32),(SRC-PORT,25862))
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gleam.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,geekx.top
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,dcg.microsoft.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,coolapk.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,jdds.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,immersivetranslate.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,imtintl.com
